  <!-- EN: spike trap MKII -->
  <TrapSpikeMKII.label>尖刺陷阱 MKII</TrapSpikeMKII.label>
  <!-- EN: Five spikes under tension, connected to a touch-activated trigger. When the victim disturbs the trigger, the spikes spring forthm and strike the victim. Since it is hidden in the surrounding terrain, it cannot be placed adjacent to other traps. Animals can sense these when calm. Has 2.75x the damage and 3x the hitpoints and a bit less ugly compared to a regular trap but is 4x as expensive to build. -->
  <TrapSpikeMKII.description>五根处于张力状态的尖刺，与一个触摸式触发器相连。当受害者触动触发器时，尖刺会弹出并击中受害者。由于它隐藏在周围的地形中，因此不能与其他陷阱相邻放置。动物在平静时可以感应到这些尖刺。伤害是普通陷阱的 2.75 倍，命中点是普通陷阱的 3 倍，外形也不那么丑陋，但建造成本是普通陷阱的 4 倍。</TrapSpikeMKII.description>
</LanguageData>